    sh:description "The source country of the product or service. Additional Information: The country of origin can be provided by the buyer as a requirement or by the tenderer information of the item to be provided. WG Approval 07/01/2020 The codelist to be used is at-voc:country which is available at http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/country" ;
    sh:name "has Item Country Of Origin" ;
    sh:path :hasItemCountryOfOrigin .

